# Shared Spec Kit workflow

Read and follow `AGENTS.md` before making changes.

- Treat `.specify/memory/constitution.md` and `specs/<feature>/` as the only sources of truth for product specifications.
- Use the project skills in `.cursor/skills/` for the constitution → specify → clarify → plan → tasks → analyze → implement → converge workflow.
- Never create a Cursor-only copy of a constitution, specification, plan, or task list.
- Persist decisions in the shared feature artifacts so Codex can continue the same work.
- Do not edit generated skill files directly; refresh the `cursor-agent` integration with the Specify CLI.
